<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Roblox PARKOUR AUTO DOUBLE WALLRUN</Major>
    <Description>Hello! I made this script to auto double wallrun!

How to use: Simple do a double wallboost or a single wallboost on a large building, then simple activate the macro, it will auto do it for you then stop!

The double wallrun is about 80% consistent, just make sure you're high enough in the building so it doesn't run out and you fall to your death!

Screen resolution: 1920x1080

Enjoy :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
